  "description": "Humans have always been hunters, and at times they’ve even hunted other humans. KH-7, the latest android and a government agent, has awoken in such a world. In this dystopia where the Intelligence Division rules supreme and “log tracers” collect terrorists’ memories, KH-7 serves to impart justice. But with no grasp on his real identity and only vague memories of “Eternity Land,” his deceased wife, and their taken child, he sets out for vengeance and his past, only to discover some unsettling truths...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
